                                            "A tarp, a heavy, waterproof sheet of material, often cloth, used as a cover or blanket."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "237ce7a7-6909-431c-8c19-8b45a0e9aa50",
                                                "sense_id": "83db2dfd-b62b-3381-b851-b78e714b02bc",
                                                "text": "Throw a tarpaulin over that woodpile before it gets wet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
